<preface xml:id="note-on-this-edition">
  <title>Note on This PreTeXt Edition</title>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    This is a <url href="https://pretextbook.org/">PreTeXt</url> conversion of <em>Introduction to Modern Statistics</em> (Second Edition), originally written by Mine Çetinkaya-Rundel and Johanna Hardin. The original work is available online at <url href="https://openintro-ims.netlify.app/">openintro-ims.netlify.app</url>, and the original GitHub repository for the book source is <url href="https://github.com/openintrostat/ims">github.com/openintrostat/ims</url>.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    This PreTeXt edition was prepared by the <url href="https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/ims">PreTeXtBooks project</url> to make the content available in the PreTeXt format, enabling accessible and structured output in HTML, PDF, and other formats. All prose, code examples, figures, and mathematical content are intended to be faithful reproductions of the original work, though occasional typographical errors may have been introduced in the conversion process. Report any issues to our <url href="https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/ims/issues">GitHub Issues page</url>.
  </p>

